    "description": "This eclectic jewelry collection features fine, artisan, and vintage pieces with various metalwork and gemstones:\nSterling Silver (.925) Amethyst Ring Size 5: Oval-cut natural purple amethyst set in a woven bypass band, stamped .925 on the interior band. Includes display ring box.\nMET Stamped Amber Statement Ring Size 8: Large oval cabochon amber-colored stone in a high-bezel silver frame, stamped MET on the back. Includes velvet ring box.\nMother of Pearl Bird Necklace: Carved fan-wing eagle/bird pendant crafted from natural iridescent mother-of-pearl shell on a silver-tone chain.\nPendants & Keychains: Features a slice-cut pink agate/rhodochrosite pendant, an abalone/mother-of-pearl inlaid sea turtle brooch, a carved silver-tone turtle pendant, an angel keychain, and a gymnast/dancer pendant on a chain.\nCharms & Earrings: Includes 5 birthstone-style family child pendants, teardrop/water-droplet sterling style earrings, vintage damascene-style screw-back earrings, and a forest tree line bar brooch.\n Assorted Chains: Multiple long silver-tone chain necklaces including snake, cable, and curb links.\nCondition:\nVintage pre-owned condition. Silver pieces exhibit natural aging and light patina. Rings and components show minor wear consistent with gentle use. Sold as a lot as shown in photos.",
